    "K_t": "Evidence:\n[1] In 2004, World Wrestling Entertainment (WWE), the WWF's successor, reinstated the WWE Hall of Fame, which included inductees that were alumni of WWE, NWA, JCP, and WCW.\n[2] He was a charter inductee of the Wrestling Observer Newsletter Hall of Fame in 1996.\n[3] Jerry Stubbs is a retired professional wrestler.\n[4] Watts was famous under his \"Cowboy\" gimmick in his wrestling career, and then as a tough, no-nonsense promoter in the Mid-South United States, which grew to become the Universal Wrestling Federation (UWF).\n\nNotes:\n[bridge] The WWE Hall of Fame includes inductees from various wrestling organizations such as NWA, JCP, and WCW."
